# The SageMaker training toolkit that runs sm_entry.py in the Geneformer image. It is not part of
# uv.lock (it pulls a web stack the project does not use), so it has its own hash-locked file.
# Versions that uv.lock also pins are held to the uv.lock versions with a constraints file, so
# installing this file never changes a package the project is tested with. Regenerate:
#   uv export --frozen --no-emit-project --no-hashes --format requirements-txt -o /tmp/constraints.txt
#   uv pip compile sagemaker/requirements-toolkit.in -c /tmp/constraints.txt \
#     -o sagemaker/requirements-toolkit.txt --python-version 3.11 \
#     --python-platform x86_64-manylinux_2_35 --generate-hashes
sagemaker-training
